+//! only over-report).
+//!
+//! Sampled (PR #138 review): [`RINGS`] rings at radii `d k / RINGS`,
+//! `k = 1..=RINGS` about the centre, ring k holding `2 k` points (the
+//! rim's [`RIM`] = 16 density scaled by radius). A sample on ring k is
